REXX Overview

Version REXX-bREXX-2.1.9-CMS370-1.1.0 - 02 Jan 2025

The VM/370 Community Edition features an integrated version of bREXX.  REXX
procedures have a filetype of EXEC, and must begin with "/* on the first line.

Help is available for all Rexx instructions and built-in functions.  Simply
type "HELP REXX name" (e.g., HELP REXX ABBREV)
